---

This product bundles third-party components. Their licences and full texts are kept alongside
the vendored sources under native/*/third_party/, and are listed together in
src/oreo_runtime/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

  SDL2             zlib licence      native/controller_support/third_party/SDL2/LICENSE.txt
  Dear ImGui       MIT               native/overlay/third_party/imgui/LICENSE.txt
  MinHook          BSD 2-clause      native/overlay/third_party/minhook/LICENSE.txt
  Vulkan-Headers   Apache-2.0 / MIT  native/overlay/third_party/Vulkan-Headers/LICENSE.md
  Roboto (font)    Apache-2.0        src/oreo_runtime/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md

SDL2 ships as a DLL next to the controller helper; the others are compiled into the overlay.

Project Oreo Runtime is loaded by pyMHF and NMSpy, and is installed by Project Oreo Launcher.
Those are separate projects under their own licences and no part of them is included here.
